    "Several of my earlier choices explicitly centered on Christmas, including two interactions with The Classic Christmas Album, making the seasonal connection meaningful to me.",
    "My latest choice, The New Old Fashioned, came much later than those Christmas albums, so I would appreciate choices that connect with that album as well rather than assuming my earlier seasonal interest explains everything."
